From 1b9fed5700d92a0d45a527e892238bfa215478e4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: blame42 <346530647+git-blame-42@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 16:42:35 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: List and manage only the logged admin events

The index paginates currentUser()->events(); show, edit, update and destroy look the event up through events()->findById, so another admin's event is reported as not found. The populate gets a second admin (admin2@example.com) with three events.
---
 app/Controllers/Admin/EventsController.php    |  34 ++++-
 database/Populate/populate.php                |  59 ++++++++-
 .../admin/events/ListEventsCest.php           |  26 ++++
 tests/Integration/Access/EventsAccessTest.php |  14 ++
 .../Admin/EventsControllerTest.php            | 120 ++++++++++++++++++
 5 files changed, 242 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)

